      "outgoing_boundary": "Example 2 reaches x=6 and ends with a full stop before footer; no unfinished prose on this page.",
      "rows": [
        {"n": 1, "y_approx": 345, "kind": "p-cont", "text": "的根叫做以 $a$ 为底，$b$ 的对数。"},
        {"n": 2, "y_approx": 457, "kind": "p", "text": "例如，方程 $3^x=81$ 的根（也就是 $4$）是以 $3$ 为底，$81$ 的对"},
        {"n": 3, "y_approx": 570, "kind": "p", "text": "数；方程 $10^x=0.001$ 的根（也就是 $-3$）是以 $10$ 为底，$0.001$ 的"},
        {"n": 4, "y_approx": 683, "kind": "p", "text": "对数。"},
        {"n": 5, "y_approx": 796, "kind": "p-definition", "text": "定义 如果 $a(a>0,a\\ne0)$ 的幂等于 $b$，幂指数就叫做以"},
        {"n": 6, "y_approx": 910, "kind": "p-definition", "text": "$a$ 为底，$b$ 的对数。"},
        {"n": 7, "y_approx": 1024, "kind": "p", "text": "以 $a$ 为底 $b$ 的对数通常记作 $\\log_a b$（读作《以 $a$ 为底 $b$ 的"},
        {"n": 8, "y_approx": 1137, "kind": "p", "text": "对数》）"},
        {"n": 9, "y_approx": 1249, "kind": "p", "text": "根据对数的定义，$\\log_2 8$ 是 $2$ 的幂等于 $8$ 时相应的幂指"},
        {"n": 10, "y_approx": 1375, "kind": "p", "text": "数。容易看出，$\\log_2 8=3$，因为 $2^3=8$。类似地，因为 $3^{-4}=\\frac{1}{81}$，"},
        {"n": 11, "y_approx": 1552, "kind": "p", "text": "$\\log_3\\frac{1}{81}=-4$；因为 $5^0=1$，$\\log_5 1=0$。"},
        {"n": 12, "y_approx": 1687, "kind": "p", "text": "我们发现，因为方程 $3^x=-27$，$2^x=0$ 没有根，所以象"},
        {"n": 13, "y_approx": 1800, "kind": "p", "text": "$\\log_3(-27)$，$\\log_2 0$ 这种表示式没有意义。"},
        {"n": 14, "y_approx": 1915, "kind": "p-domain", "text": "一般地，仅当 $b>0$ 时，$\\log_a b(a>0,a\\ne1)$ 才有意义。"},
        {"n": 15, "y_approx": 2028, "kind": "p", "text": "我们来看例子。"},
        {"n": 16, "y_approx": 2142, "kind": "p-example", "text": "例1 已知以 $2$ 为底 $b$ 的对数等于 $-5$，求数 $b$。"},
        {"n": 17, "y_approx": 2255, "kind": "p", "text": "根据已知条件，$\\log_2 b=-5$，其中 $b$ 是所求的数。利用对"},
        {"n": 18, "y_approx": 2369, "kind": "p", "text": "数的定义，得到："},
        {"n": 19, "y_approx": 2490, "kind": "p-formula", "text": "$b=2^{-5}$，也就是 $b=\\frac{1}{32}$。"},
        {"n": 20, "y_approx": 2644, "kind": "p-example", "text": "例2 求 $125$ 以 $\\sqrt{5}$ 为底的对数。"},
        {"n": 21, "y_approx": 2766, "kind": "p", "text": "设所求的对数是 $x$，于是 $(\\sqrt{5})^x=125$。"},
        {"n": 22, "y_approx": 2880, "kind": "p", "text": "为了解所得到的方程，我们把它的每一边都写成底数为"},
        {"n": 23, "y_approx": 3000, "kind": "p", "text": "$5$ 的幂，于是 $5^{\\frac{1}{2}x}=5^3$。因此 $\\frac{1}{2}x=3$，也就是 $x=6$。"},
        {"n": 24, "y_approx": 3164, "kind": "foot", "text": "225"}
      ],
      "errata_verdict": {
        "status": "confirmed-printed-mathematical-erratum",
        "pixel_evidence": "Both the grid and independent definition crop show the rounded digit 0 after the not-equal sign, not 1. Later domain statement on this same grid prints not-equal 1.",
        "original": "$a(a>0,a\\ne0)$",
        "mathematical_correction_for_erratum_only": "$a(a>0,a\\ne1)$",
        "reason": "For a positive base, a=1 is the unique degenerate excluded base: 1^x=1 for every real x, so the exponent is not unique for b=1 and no exponent exists for b!=1. Positive bases other than 1 give an injective exponential with positive range. The printed a!=0 is redundant with a>0 and fails to exclude 1.",
        "additional_definition_error": false,
        "b_positive_note": "b>0 follows from being a positive-base power and is explicitly stated later. Do not invent an additional transcription change.",
        "faithful_source_action": "Retain printed 0 in source formula; register bound erratum. Never classify replacing 0 by 1 as transcription correction."
      }
    },
