      "n36_closure": "Immediately after complete 731 and before actual h3 37. 常用对数. Page order is exhead, ex731, h3; the h3's expected structural ref is p0234#3.",
      "outgoing_boundary": "733 begins on the page and only а and б are visible before footer. This is full-page source observation, not approval of complete 733 or N37.",
      "rows": [
        {"n": 1, "y_approx": 390, "kind": "exhead", "text": "复习题"},
        {"n": 2, "y_approx": 530, "kind": "ex-731", "text": "731. 作出由公式"},
        {"n": 3, "y_approx": 646, "kind": "ex-731", "text": "$y=2x+3(x\\in[0,+\\infty[)$"},
        {"n": 4, "y_approx": 753, "kind": "ex-731", "text": "给出的函数 $f$ 的图象。"},
        {"n": 5, "y_approx": 865, "kind": "ex-731", "text": "用方程给出函数 $f$ 的相反关系 $g$。指出关系 $g$ 的定义域"},
        {"n": 6, "y_approx": 979, "kind": "ex-731", "text": "和值域。作出关系 $g$ 的图象。"},
        {"n": 7, "y_approx": 1186, "kind": "h3", "text": "37. 常用对数"},
        {"n": 8, "y_approx": 1330, "kind": "p", "text": "在实际计算中，广泛应用以 $10$ 为底的对数，即常用对数。"},
        {"n": 9, "y_approx": 1443, "kind": "p", "text": "对于常用对数用特殊的符号表示，就是把 $\\log_{10}b$（$b$ 是任意的"},
        {"n": 10, "y_approx": 1556, "kind": "p", "text": "正数）写成 $\\lg b$。例如，把 $\\log_{10}1000$ 写成 $\\lg1000$，把 $\\log_{10}35$"},
        {"n": 11, "y_approx": 1665, "kind": "p", "text": "写成 $\\lg35$。"},
        {"n": 12, "y_approx": 1775, "kind": "p", "text": "根据常用对数的定义，$\\lg b$ 是以 $10$ 为底的幂等于 $b$ 时的"},
        {"n": 13, "y_approx": 1885, "kind": "p", "text": "幂指数。就是说，当 $b$ 是任何正数时，等式"},
        {"n": 14, "y_approx": 2000, "kind": "p-formula", "text": "$10^{\\lg b}=b$"},
        {"n": 15, "y_approx": 2120, "kind": "p", "text": "成立。也就是说，在正数集合上，这个等式是恒等式。"},
        {"n": 16, "y_approx": 2230, "kind": "p", "text": "利用这个恒等式，求出："},
        {"n": 17, "y_approx": 2340, "kind": "p-formula", "text": "$10^{\\lg100}=100$，$10^{\\lg0.1}=0.1$，$10^{\\lg5}=5$。"},
        {"n": 18, "y_approx": 2450, "kind": "ex-732", "text": "732. 利用常用对数符号表示下列等式中的幂指数："},
        {"n": 19, "y_approx": 2560, "kind": "ex-732", "text": "а) $10^2=100$； б) $10^7=10000000$；"},
        {"n": 20, "y_approx": 2670, "kind": "ex-732", "text": "в) $10^{-3}=0.001$； г) $10^{-6}=0.000001$；"},
        {"n": 21, "y_approx": 2810, "kind": "ex-732", "text": "д) $10^{\\frac{1}{2}}=\\sqrt{10}$； е) $10^{2.5}=100\\sqrt{10}$。"},
        {"n": 22, "y_approx": 2930, "kind": "ex-733-open", "text": "733. 证明下列等式成立："},
        {"n": 23, "y_approx": 3045, "kind": "ex-733-open", "text": "а) $\\lg1000=3$； б) $\\lg100000=5$；"},
        {"n": 24, "y_approx": 3175, "kind": "foot", "text": "227"}
      ],
